.TH VDR-SKIN-ANTHRA-UPDATE 8 "October 2026" "vdr-skin-anthra-common" "VDR"
.SH NAME
vdr-skin-anthra-update \- build anthra skins for the VDR text2skin plugin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vdr-skin-anthra-update
.RI [ SKIN ...]
.br
.B vdr-skin-anthra-update \-\-remove
.IR SKIN ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
The anthra skins are generated from XML parts according to a set of options
(channel logos, EPG images, fonts, menu logos and more).
.B vdr-skin-anthra-update
builds a skin from its sources in
.I /usr/share/vdr-skin-anthra/SKIN
and its options in
.I /etc/vdr/anthra/SKIN.conf
into
.IR /var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin/SKIN ,
where text2skin finds it.
.PP
Without arguments all installed anthra skins are built. The skin packages
call it on installation and upgrade, so local options survive upgrades.
After changing the options run it again and restart VDR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-remove
Remove the built skins, used by the skin packages on removal.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show a short usage message.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/vdr/anthra/SKIN.conf
Options of the skin (make syntax, slashes in paths escaped with backslashes).
.TP
.I /usr/share/vdr-skin-anthra/SKIN
Skin sources.
.TP
.I /var/lib/vdr/plugins/text2skin/SKIN
Built skin.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR vdr (1)
